-- GENERATED by tools/SlutmogScout/build_items.py. Do not edit by hand.
--   * every BoE chest and leg piece of uncommon quality or better
--   * the share of bare skin is measured from the transparency of the
--     piece's female body textures
--   * where the skin is bare counts: bust and belly over shoulders, thighs over
--     hips and knees, shins not at all (weights in build_items.py)
--   * kept: chest pieces scoring 24%+, leg pieces scoring 21%+
--   * dropped: anything a profession recipe creates
--   req  required level (rule of thumb: world drops come from mobs about req..req+5)
--   src  "dungeon": listed as loot in a Forever dungeon (inst); "world": not in the
--        dungeon journal, so most likely a world drop; anything else: see srcNote
--   skin weighted bare share in percent
--   display  the item's display id: pieces sharing it look the same
--   shared   how many items in the whole game wear this look (1: no other item does)
--   pool     BoE uncommon/rare world drops within 3 levels: the bigger, the rarer each one drops
--   alt      the other items with this look, by how they are had: made (crafted), plain (white or
--            grey, often a vendor item), bop (bind on pickup), boe (another BoE item), unk (an
--            item new in Forever that no table names: how it is had is not known);
--            altName names one of them, the easiest to get first
--   same     those items by name, the easiest to get first (at most 4): how as in alt, inst the
--            dungeon it drops in. The addon warns with these (SuccuDev, 2026-11-16: "you failed
--            to warn me saltstone surcoat has a dungeon item with the same model")
--   grade    bikini, skimpy or cropped: what kind of garment it is (rules in build_items.py);
--            cropped pieces (shirts and breastplates listed only for a bare belly or
--            shoulders, mid-thigh shorts) are hidden unless the player asks for them
--            or rated 4+; gradeNote: graded by hand (GRADE_BY_HAND) or in the review, and why
--   rating   SuccuDev's look rating 1-10 from the Review tab: it scales the slutmog worth
--   est      the estimated look rating 1-10, judged by eye from a render (data/look_ratings.json),
--            used where nobody has rated it; estNote says what the look is
--   sell     what a vendor pays for one (copper): the base of the slutmog worth
--   common   how often it drops against the other pieces on the list, 0 (the rarest) to 100 (the
--            most common): copies looted per hour across a realm, from the CMaNGOS Classic loot
--            tables (chance per kill) and an assumed kill rate per spawn point (loot.py)
--   drop     the best mob to farm it alone: mob, its level lo-hi, zone, pct (chance per kill),
--            hours (for one copy, farming alone); elite, rare, inst (inside a dungeon)
--   ns.REVIEW   every other BoE chest and leg piece that is not crafted, for the Review tab:
--               what was measured (skin, look) and why it is not on the list (why)
--   ns.CRAFTED  chest and leg pieces made by a profession, never suggested as missing
